5
00:00:45,166 --> 00:00:49,041
Silakan gabung
di Pesta Sambetan Sanggar Bondan.

6
00:00:49,833 --> 00:00:55,708
Ini hari kita bawa roh kupu,
roh kancil, sama roh kuda.

7
00:00:55,791 --> 00:00:59,833
Nah, buat yang mau disambetin,
boleh langsung samperin,

8
00:01:00,500 --> 00:01:05,416
Pimpinan perasuk kita hari ini,
Bang Yoga Nugraha.

9
00:01:07,416 --> 00:01:10,083
Bisa juga samperin asistennya,

10
00:01:10,166 --> 00:01:14,041
