31
00:02:29,791 --> 00:02:32,458
Bareng-bareng kita lupain bentar, ya,

32
00:02:32,541 --> 00:02:36,916
gawean, cicilan, masalah keluarga.

33
00:02:37,666 --> 00:02:41,166
Yuk, kita bareng-bareng
lepasin semua di Alam Sambet.

34
00:02:41,791 --> 00:02:44,458
Nyatu semua sama roh kupu.

35
00:02:44,541 --> 00:02:45,666
Iya, begitu.

36
00:02:47,416 --> 00:02:53,125
Oh, iya, kita ucapin juga nih,
selamat datang buat Guru Asri,

37
00:02:53,208 --> 00:02:56,208
