Lah, ngapa mandek?

40
00:03:09,875 --> 00:03:11,416
Saya lagi cari perasuk baru.

41
00:03:11,916 --> 00:03:15,041
Lanjutin coba.
Masukin dah tuh ke Alam Sambet.

42
00:03:52,666 --> 00:03:55,416
<i>Cakep, udah masuk.</i>

43
00:03:56,916 --> 00:04:01,708
