55
00:04:39,916 --> 00:04:42,375
<i>Kalau lagi pengen sosis,</i>
<i>ya pengen sendiri aja.</i>

56
00:04:42,458 --> 00:04:44,541
<i>Kagak usah bawa-bawa ke Alam Sambet.</i>

57
00:04:44,625 --> 00:04:45,708
