59
00:04:59,583 --> 00:05:00,833
<i>Madu, madu, madu,</i>

60
00:05:00,916 --> 00:05:01,875
<i>madu, madu, madu,</i>

61
00:05:01,958 --> 00:05:03,291
<i>madu, madu, madu… Telor!</i>

62
00:05:06,916 --> 00:05:10,041
<i>Eh, ini madu bukan telor.</i>

63
00:05:11,000 --> 00:05:13,041
Ini roh kupu bukan uler.

64
00:05:13,583 --> 00:05:15,583
Kalo masalah konsen aja belum beres,

65
00:05:15,666 --> 00:05:17,916
