<i>Sleep</i> paralayang.

902
01:00:23,791 --> 01:00:25,041
Makanya, Bay,

903
01:00:25,125 --> 01:00:26,833
lu jadi melayang-layang gitu, 'kan?

904
01:00:26,916 --> 01:00:28,458
- Anjay.
- Anjay.

905
01:00:28,541 --> 01:00:29,375
Anjay.

906
01:00:29,875 --> 01:00:30,916
Ya dulu,

907
01:00:31,333 --> 01:00:33,750
Pakde Rahmat, Bapak, sama Tante Wati,

908
01:00:33,833 --> 01:00:36,583
sering ikut sambetan, tanya aja sendiri.

909
01:00:36,666 --> 01:00:37,541
Orang masih hidup.

910
01:00:37,625 --> 01:00:38,875
Kemasukan apa, Pak?

911
01:00:38,958 --> 01:00:39,958
Jadi kodok?

912
01:00:40,833 --> 01:00:42,458
- Anjay kodok.
- Ya itu sih…

913
01:00:43,166 --> 01:00:45,750
Itu waktu di SD sama SMP doang,

914
01:00:45,833 --> 01:00:47,166
abis itu udah nggak lagi.

915
01:00:47,250 --> 01:00:48,791
Tapi emang,

916
01:00:48,875 --> 01:00:53,333
temen Pakde banyak yang masih
main gitu-gituan meskipun udah tua.

917
01:00:54,458 --> 01:00:55,583
Ngeliatnya nggak enak.

918
01:00:55,666 --> 01:00:56,666
Kagak maju-maju.

919
01:00:56,750 --> 01:01:00,333
Pak Banar, sampai sekarang,
seneng-seneng aja hidupnya.

920
01:01:00,416 --> 01:01:02,625
Mobilnya bagus, HP-nya cakep.

921
01:01:03,333 --> 01:01:05,125
Pak Banar kagak nikah, Yu.

922
01:01:05,208 --> 01:01:07,208
Emang lu mau, sendirian mulu sampai tua?

923
01:01:07,291 --> 01:01:10,916
Loh, orang kemarin Bayu ketemu
cewenya di toko bayi.

924
01:01:11,000 --> 01:01:13,416
Ya tapi orang-orang Latas aja
udah pada jual tanah,

925
01:01:13,500 --> 01:01:15,875
Entar lu nyambetin siapa?
Nyambetin buldozer?

926
01:01:15,958 --> 01:01:19,000
Lu ceritain dong,
kemarin lu itu abis dapet apa tuh?

927
01:01:19,083 --> 01:01:19,958
Promosi.

928
01:01:20,333 --> 01:01:22,583
Dia 'kan umurnya
sebelas dua belas sama lu, Yu,

929
01:01:23,208 --> 01:01:25,708
udah nabung buat nikah, beli rumah.

930
01:01:25,791 --> 01:01:27,000
Tahun depan.

931
01:01:28,166 --> 01:01:29,000
Lu kapan?

932
01:01:29,083 --> 01:01:30,166
Mau <i>dewean</i> mulu lu?

933
01:01:30,250 --> 01:01:32,666
Ya bodo amat, gua milihnya beda.

934
01:01:32,750 --> 01:01:35,291
Kerja kagak cuma buat kawin
sama punya anak kali.

935
01:01:35,375 --> 01:01:36,416
Maksud lu apaan?

936
01:01:36,500 --> 01:01:40,125
Gua milih kerja,
yang bisa ngebantu orang lain,

937
01:01:40,208 --> 01:01:41,750
Nyembuhin orang lain.

938
01:01:41,833 --> 01:01:43,458
Bukan mikirin perut sendiri doang.

939
01:01:43,541 --> 01:01:45,916
Lu ngeledek kerjaan gua
kagak ngebantu orang lain?

940
01:01:46,000 --> 01:01:47,625
Liat aja entar 10 tahun lagi,

941
01:01:47,708 --> 01:01:50,208
- siapa yang sering sedekah.
- Gua gak ngomong gitu.

942
01:01:50,291 --> 01:01:51,125
Lu ngomong tadi.

943
01:01:51,208 --> 01:01:54,000
Gimana kalo 10 tahun lagi
orang udah ninggalin sambetan?

944
01:01:54,083 --> 01:01:56,708
Yang ada lu ngerepotin orang
karena kagak punya gawean.

945
01:01:56,791 --> 01:01:58,375
Gua cuma bilang,

946
01:01:58,458 --> 01:02:00,291
hidup orang itu beda-beda,

947
01:02:00,375 --> 01:02:02,041
Kesenengan orang juga beda-beda.

948
01:02:02,125 --> 01:02:04,541
Gua kagak pernah ngerepotin lu,
ngapain lu ngatur?

949
01:02:04,625 --> 01:02:06,250
Duit makan lu dari bokap gua kali.

950
01:02:06,333 --> 01:02:07,791
Ya udah kagak usah kirim lagi.

951
01:02:07,875 --> 01:02:08,791
Eh, udah!

952
01:02:08,875 --> 01:02:10,541
Ngomong kenceng banget lu pada!

953
01:02:10,625 --> 01:02:11,750
Kayak RX King!

954
01:02:11,833 --> 01:02:14,291
Sekali ketemu aja, langsung aja ribut.

955
01:02:19,208 --> 01:02:20,875
Biasa aja kali.

956
01:02:21,833 --> 01:02:24,958
Yu, ama keluarga jangan gitu ngapa, Yu.

957
01:02:25,583 --> 01:02:26,541
Kagak enak tau.

958
01:02:26,625 --> 01:02:29,166
Lagian Bapak tadi kenapa ngomong dah?

959
01:02:29,250 --> 01:02:30,375
'Kan Bapak udah janji.

960
01:02:30,458 --> 01:02:32,500
Lagian itu rumah, bukan cuma punya Bapak.

961
01:02:33,083 --> 01:02:34,500
Dah bilang Bapak begitu.

962
01:02:36,208 --> 01:02:38,750
'Kan Bayu udah janji
Bayu yang bakal nyicil itu rumah.

963
01:02:38,833 --> 01:02:41,708
Ini Bayu udah masuk empat besar, Pak,
kurang satu tahap lagi.

964
01:02:41,791 --> 01:02:43,833
Tapi 'kan tetep belum ada jaminan kepilih.

965
01:02:43,958 --> 01:02:45,791
Dan kalo mau nyicil, berapa lama, Yu?

966
01:02:45,875 --> 01:02:47,333
Mendingan lama tapi pasti,

967
01:02:47,416 --> 01:02:52,375
daripada entar kalo Bapak
buka bisnis lagi sama Bu Nana gagal,

968
01:02:52,458 --> 01:02:55,000
disamperin <i>debt collector</i> lagi entar.

969
01:02:55,083 --> 01:02:58,125
Ini baru sehari di Jakarta aja
langsung engap napas.

970
01:02:58,833 --> 01:03:01,958
Uyab!

971
01:03:02,583 --> 01:03:06,208
Yab, sori ya,
tadi gua kagak maksud bikin lu emosi.

972
01:03:06,583 --> 01:03:07,708
Gua kepancing doang.

973
01:03:07,791 --> 01:03:10,958
Eh, kita berempat mau rileks dikit nih,
lu ikut ya?

974
01:03:11,958 --> 01:03:14,375
Kagak dulu dah,
gua mesti langsung balik ini malam.

975
01:03:14,458 --> 01:03:16,541
Ya elah, payah lu!

976
01:03:16,833 --> 01:03:18,000
Ayo, sekali-kali!

977
01:03:18,083 --> 01:03:19,958
- Ayo, Bay!
- Ayo lah!

978
01:03:20,041 --> 01:03:21,583
Ya udah berangkat aja, Yu.

979
01:03:21,666 --> 01:03:24,958
Kagak enak,
sekali-sekali nyenengin keluarga.

980
01:03:25,041 --> 01:03:27,000
Pakde Rahmat 'kan udah baik sama kita.

981
01:03:27,083 --> 01:03:29,250
- Ya?
- Ayo buruan, gua tunggu depan, ya?

982
01:03:29,333 --> 01:03:30,708
Ayo, ayo, ayo!

983
01:03:40,625 --> 01:03:41,458
Bay!

984
01:03:41,541 --> 01:03:44,041
<i>Dokem-dokem bae</i> lu kayak ikan cupang!

985
01:03:45,958 --> 01:03:49,000
Ayo ke tengah kali, ya elah!

986
01:03:50,041 --> 01:03:51,541
- Kagak mainan gua.
- Apa?

987
01:03:51,625 --> 01:03:52,791
Kagak mainan gua.

988
01:03:52,875 --> 01:03:54,416
Kagak mainan!

989
01:03:54,500 --> 01:03:56,416
Elah, Yu sini gue ajarin joget, ayo!

990
01:03:56,500 --> 01:03:58,000
Ajarin, Ca!

991
01:04:00,583 --> 01:04:02,333
Anjay!

992
01:04:02,416 --> 01:04:05,166
Eh, Bay, ini minum dulu, biar panas.

993
01:04:05,250 --> 01:04:07,458
Kagak minum gua,
kagak minum kayak gini-ginian.

994
01:04:08,833 --> 01:04:10,875
Soalnya biasa mabuk sama sapi, coy.

995
01:04:10,958 --> 01:04:13,083
Udah lah gak usah dipaksa.

996
01:04:13,166 --> 01:04:15,250
Dia mah doyannya sesajen.

997
01:04:16,708 --> 01:04:19,750
Gua tau nih bocah,
kalo di sono dugemnya begini.

998
01:04:19,833 --> 01:04:21,125
Gimana, Bang?

999
01:04:21,208 --> 01:04:22,333
Oh, iya!

1000
01:04:22,583 --> 01:04:24,125
Banteng, banteng.

1001
01:04:26,416 --> 01:04:28,541
Gantian, Bang. Siap-siap.

1002
01:04:29,166 --> 01:04:32,208
- Jadi apa, nih?
- Jadi roh macan!

1003
01:05:41,208 --> 01:05:42,333
Gimana?

1004
01:05:42,416 --> 01:05:43,583
Enak kagak?

1005
01:05:44,458 --> 01:05:45,625
Ya…

1006
01:05:46,583 --> 01:05:47,416
Enak.

1007
01:05:47,500 --> 01:05:50,125
Eh, Spiderman malah pacaran.

1008
01:05:52,333 --> 01:05:53,416
Berat.

1009
01:05:55,208 --> 01:05:56,666
Maaf, Bang.

1010
01:06:01,708 --> 01:06:06,208
Ya, cakep sih, tapi kagak secakep kemarin.

1011
01:06:07,333 --> 01:06:08,166
Mikirin apaan?

1012
01:06:08,250 --> 01:06:10,500
Saudara-saudara saya di Jakarta, Bu.

1013
01:06:11,583 --> 01:06:12,416
Terus?

1014
01:06:12,833 --> 01:06:17,208
Ya, mereka ngejek kerjaan kita.

1015
01:06:18,083 --> 01:06:19,708
Ngajakin minum.

1016
01:06:19,791 --> 01:06:23,458
Pakde maksa Bapak saya jual rumah,
ya gitu-gitu lah, Bu.

1017
01:06:24,083 --> 01:06:27,375
Ya, jadi ngomong-ngomong pas situ
lagi mabok-mabokan di Jakarta…

1018
01:06:27,458 --> 01:06:29,250
Lah, saya kagak mabok Bu!

1019
01:06:29,333 --> 01:06:32,583
…warga nyalonin satu perasuk baru.

1020
01:06:33,208 --> 01:06:34,333
Heh, Bocah!

1021
01:06:34,416 --> 01:06:35,708
Bu! Iya, iya!

1022
01:06:35,791 --> 01:06:36,958
- Sini!
- Misi, misi.

1023
01:06:38,750 --> 01:06:39,583
Bu.

1024
01:06:40,125 --> 01:06:40,958
Iya.

1025
01:06:41,208 --> 01:06:43,333
Menyala abangku.

1026
01:06:43,416 --> 01:06:46,833
Abis ini coba siap-siap buat gantiin Bayu,

1027
01:06:46,916 --> 01:06:49,250
karena warga pengen lihat kemampuan situ.

1028
01:06:49,333 --> 01:06:50,208
Bawa roh apaan?

1029
01:06:50,708 --> 01:06:51,541
Ini, Bu.

1030
01:06:53,000 --> 01:06:55,375
Wow, ya udah.

1031
01:06:55,458 --> 01:06:56,708
Siap-siap.

1032
01:07:05,708 --> 01:07:10,208
Bu, ini mah kagak adil, Bu, namanya.

1033
01:07:10,750 --> 01:07:15,583
Dia 'kan kagak ikut pemilihan dari awal,
<i>ujug-ujug</i> mimpin pesta.

1034
01:07:15,666 --> 01:07:18,000
Bocah lain juga
pada kagak terima kali, Bu.

1035
01:07:18,083 --> 01:07:19,458
Kagak terima?

1036
01:07:19,541 --> 01:07:22,291
Lah, yang minta warga, bukan saya.

1037
01:07:22,375 --> 01:07:25,458
Siapa tau aja dia
puasanya lebih banyak dari yang lain.

1038
01:07:25,583 --> 01:07:26,875
Liatin aja dulu.

1039
01:07:27,958 --> 01:07:29,583
- Permisi, Bu, Pak.
- Iya.

1040
01:07:32,833 --> 01:07:35,583
Latas susah air, mandilah di alam gaib!

1041
01:07:35,666 --> 01:07:38,041
Kerbau berantem sampai tumbang!

1042
01:07:38,125 --> 01:07:40,916
Dikau mandi pake kembang!

1043
01:07:54,541 --> 01:07:55,708
Sabunan!

1044
01:07:55,791 --> 01:07:57,375
Sabunan dulu!

1045
01:08:11,916 --> 01:08:13,083
Keramas!

1046
01:08:13,166 --> 01:08:15,000
Saatnya keramas!

1047
01:08:29,958 --> 01:08:31,250
Sikat gigi dulu!

1048
01:08:42,750 --> 01:08:44,375
Keringin! Keringin! Handukan!

1049
01:08:51,208 --> 01:08:52,500
Parfum! Pakai parfum!

1050
01:09:10,208 --> 01:09:11,750
- Anjir, Wit.
- Aduh.

1051
01:09:12,708 --> 01:09:14,458
Efek lu paling gokil sejauh ini.

1052
01:09:15,083 --> 01:09:15,916
Seger banget.

1053
01:09:16,458 --> 01:09:17,333
Lumayan, deh.

1054
01:09:18,375 --> 01:09:19,458
Cakep!

1055
01:09:21,583 --> 01:09:25,333
Para Tetua,
masukin nama Pawit di papan, ya.

1056
01:09:26,208 --> 01:09:30,416
Doni, Yuli, makasih udah ikutan
pemilihan kita.

1057
01:09:30,500 --> 01:09:33,125
Saya doain lancar-lancar
ke depannya, ya. Makasih.

1058
01:09:33,208 --> 01:09:34,125
Bu.

1059
01:09:34,208 --> 01:09:36,125
Kagak bisa seenaknya gini dong, Bu.

1060
01:09:36,958 --> 01:09:38,333
Seenaknya?

1061
01:09:39,625 --> 01:09:41,708
Eh, yang penting buat kita

1062
01:09:42,583 --> 01:09:45,625
itu warga betah tinggal di Latas,

1063
01:09:45,708 --> 01:09:48,166
kagak jual tanah ke Wanaria.

1064
01:09:48,250 --> 01:09:50,416
Nah, kita 'kan perlu perasuk
yang paling jago.

1065
01:09:50,500 --> 01:09:53,250
Kalau konsentrasi aja
masih keganggu saudara di Jakarta,

1066
01:09:53,333 --> 01:09:55,625
jangan-jangan situ emang
pengen kerja di Jakarta?

1067
01:09:55,708 --> 01:09:56,875
Kagak usah jadi perasuk.

1068
01:09:56,958 --> 01:09:59,291
Kalo emang situ ngerasa
lebih jago dari yang lain,

1069
01:09:59,375 --> 01:10:00,750
ya buktiin, dong.

1070
01:10:00,833 --> 01:10:03,791
Dapetin tuh roh kelas berat.

1071
01:10:03,875 --> 01:10:05,208
Buat di final.

1072
01:10:09,208 --> 01:10:10,333
Kuda.

1073
01:10:11,833 --> 01:10:12,833
Macan.

1074
01:10:14,875 --> 01:10:15,708
Lintah.

1075
01:10:30,458 --> 01:10:32,958
<i>Bayu, Bapak jual rumah ke Fahri, ya.</i>

1076
01:10:33,041 --> 01:10:34,000
<i>Nggak apa-apa, 'kan?</i>

1077
01:10:34,708 --> 01:10:37,708
<i>Ayo Mas, pindah aja ke kota.</i>
<i>Percaya deh, udah paling bener itu.</i>

1078
01:10:37,791 --> 01:10:39,500
<i>Kalo nanti Bapak dibohongin lagi,</i>

1079
01:10:39,583 --> 01:10:42,291
<i>melarat lagi,</i>
<i>Bapak tinggal nyolong HP, ya.</i>

1080
01:10:42,375 --> 01:10:45,125
<i>Nanti yang punya HP,</i>
<i>disambetin biar kagak sadar.</i>

1081
01:10:46,000 --> 01:10:48,416
<i>Nanti kalau Bapak digebukin, Bapak bonyok,</i>

1082
01:10:48,500 --> 01:10:51,250
<i>sambetin Bapak pake roh bulus,</i>
<i>biar Bapak kebal, ya.</i>

1083
01:10:51,958 --> 01:10:55,125
<i>Bapak dipukulin,</i>
<i>malah rasanya kayak dapet pijet gratis.</i>

1084
01:10:55,208 --> 01:10:56,208
Saya macan.

1085
01:10:57,833 --> 01:10:59,375
<i>Kalau Bapak nanti dipenjara,</i>

1086
01:10:59,458 --> 01:11:01,083
<i>lu kagak bakal kelaperan,</i>

1087
01:11:01,166 --> 01:11:02,583
<i>karena lu udah biasa puasa.</i>

1088
01:11:03,583 --> 01:11:04,750
<i>Malahan ya Mas, ya,</i>

1089
01:11:04,833 --> 01:11:08,291
<i>Mas Bayu bisa dapetin</i>
<i>roh kecoak tingkat dewa kalo di kota.</i>

1090
01:11:08,958 --> 01:11:09,833
Saya lintah.

1091
01:11:46,583 --> 01:11:48,583
Ulernya ketangkep.

1092
01:11:51,083 --> 01:11:52,500
Canda.

1093
01:11:52,583 --> 01:11:54,041
Oi, Maestro Sambetan.

1094
01:11:54,125 --> 01:11:55,708
Lagi cari roh apaan?

1095
01:11:56,708 --> 01:11:57,875
Cacing?

1096
01:11:57,958 --> 01:11:59,125
Ulet bulu?

1097
01:12:01,000 --> 01:12:03,291
Oh, kagak ngomong dia.

1098
01:12:04,000 --> 01:12:06,750
Mentang-mentang lagi nyiapin
buat final tiga besar, ya?

1099
01:12:06,833 --> 01:12:10,125
Eh, gua diminta Guru Asri

1100
01:12:10,208 --> 01:12:13,208
{\an8}buat bikin kostum baru di pesta akbar.

1101
01:12:14,291 --> 01:12:19,625
Lagi magang gua, 'kan elu yang bilang,
gua jangan kerja sama Wanaria.

1102
01:12:19,708 --> 01:12:21,166
{\an8}Gua ukur dulu ya,

1103
01:12:21,250 --> 01:12:23,625
{\an8}mumpung nih lagi tengkurep.

1104
01:12:23,708 --> 01:12:25,458
Eh, kok lu nggak…

1105
01:12:26,583 --> 01:12:28,666
ngajak-ngajak gua latihan lagi, sih?

1106
01:12:29,583 --> 01:12:30,958
Gua kangen dah.

1107
01:12:33,208 --> 01:12:34,583
Kangen kesurupan.

1108
01:12:34,666 --> 01:12:36,000
Kangen kesurupan.

1109
01:12:37,708 --> 01:12:38,833
Abis ini, yuk?

1110
01:12:39,875 --> 01:12:41,500
Gua bawain lu soto.

1111
01:12:43,500 --> 01:12:45,333
<i>Bawain soto buat Laksmi.</i>

1112
01:12:46,083 --> 01:12:48,625
<i>Guru Asri milih Pawit jadi perasuk.</i>

1113
01:12:48,708 --> 01:12:50,500
<i>Laksmi demen ama Pawit.</i>

1114
01:12:50,583 --> 01:12:52,208
<i>Laksmi kawin ama Pawit.</i>

1115
01:12:53,000 --> 01:12:55,000
<i>Laksmi ama Pawit punya anak.</i>

1116
01:12:55,083 --> 01:12:56,875
<i>Bayu bakal sendirian mulu.</i>

1117
01:12:56,958 --> 01:12:58,958
<i>Orang-orang pada ninggalin.</i>

1118
01:12:59,041 --> 01:13:00,708
<i>Sendirian sampai tua.</i>

1119
01:13:00,791 --> 01:13:03,333
<i>Mati dan baru ditemuin tiga hari lagi.</i>

1120
01:13:08,708 --> 01:13:11,833
"Sama Pawit," apaan?

1121
01:13:12,625 --> 01:13:15,208
'Kan temen latihan gua elu,
ya sama elu, lah.

1122
01:13:15,291 --> 01:13:17,208
Lintah kagak ngomong.
Lintah kagak makan.

1123
01:13:17,291 --> 01:13:20,125
Lintah kagak ngomong,
lah ini lu barusan ngomong.

1124
01:13:20,208 --> 01:13:21,750
Lu kenapa sih?

1125
01:13:21,833 --> 01:13:23,083
Gua ada salah sama lu?

1126
01:14:21,875 --> 01:14:25,000
Kalau begitu udah jelas kagak adil, Pak,
buat keluarga murid saya.

1127
01:14:25,083 --> 01:14:27,750
Maaf banget, Bu, tapi saya
udah bilang berkali-kali 'kan,

1128
01:14:27,833 --> 01:14:30,750
kalau ini ada sertifikatnya,
saya beli semua tanah ini

1129
01:14:30,833 --> 01:14:33,875
- lewat makelar tanah.
- Lah mana orangnya?

1130
01:14:33,958 --> 01:14:35,375
'Kan saya minta dihadirin.

1131
01:14:35,458 --> 01:14:37,750
Dulu yang beli ini tanah
sepakat sama mak gua,

1132
01:14:37,833 --> 01:14:40,333
dia bilang, lahan ini,
bakal tetep jadi lahan hijau.

1133
01:14:40,416 --> 01:14:41,875
Lah, kenapa jadi perumahan ya?

1134
01:14:41,958 --> 01:14:45,125
Lahan ini jadi perumahan,
sawah tetangga noh, kering semua! Pe'a!

1135
01:14:45,208 --> 01:14:47,500
Ada bukti perjanjiannya,
bisa kita lihat di sini?

1136
01:14:47,583 --> 01:14:49,500
Maknya 'kan lagi jadi TKW di Qatar!

1137
01:14:49,583 --> 01:14:51,625
Kita telepon dulu ya
ibunya masnya, supaya…

1138
01:14:51,708 --> 01:14:53,125
Lu tau di Qatar jam berapa?

1139
01:14:53,208 --> 01:14:56,125
Jam 4 pagi! Mana bangun mak gua!

1140
01:14:56,208 --> 01:14:57,208
Yakin udah tidur?

1141
01:14:57,958 --> 01:14:59,750
Ya bisa jadi, barusan pulang kerja.

1142
01:14:59,833 --> 01:15:00,750
Ini orang, ya!

1143
01:15:01,208 --> 01:15:02,416
Makan, tuh!

1144
01:15:02,500 --> 01:15:05,833
Sini lu, maju lu semua!
Maju lu Wanaria semua!

1145
01:15:05,916 --> 01:15:09,541
{\an8}- Nggak takut gua sama lu semua! Pergi!
- Bubarin aja dulu sekarang!

1146
01:15:10,458 --> 01:15:11,291
Yu.

1147
01:15:12,458 --> 01:15:13,458
Yu, Bayu.

1148
01:15:13,958 --> 01:15:15,875
Bantuin ini, Yu. Ntar dulu tapanya, Yu.

1149
01:15:15,958 --> 01:15:18,041
Ini sawahnya Ananto
mau dibeli sama Wanaria.

1150
01:15:18,583 --> 01:15:21,208
Bilang ke mereka rumah lu mau
dibangun apa sama Wanaria.

1151
01:15:21,291 --> 01:15:23,375
Perjanjiannya gimana?
Kenapa sih belakangan?

1152
01:15:23,916 --> 01:15:24,750
Ngomong napa!

1153
01:15:24,833 --> 01:15:25,833
Bayu!

1154
01:15:30,291 --> 01:15:32,500
"Saya lintah, saya jadi perasuk.

1155
01:15:32,583 --> 01:15:35,166
Rumah tidak dijual.
Pawit menang, rumah dijual.

1156
01:15:35,250 --> 01:15:37,250
Ananto menang,
saya mesti balik ke Jakarta.

1157
01:15:37,333 --> 01:15:40,375
Laksmi ganggu, saya lintah,
saya menang, rumah saya di sini."

1158
01:15:41,208 --> 01:15:42,458
Oh, marah?

1159
01:15:42,541 --> 01:15:45,958
Gegara ada nama Pawit Arifin di pemilihan?

1160
01:15:46,041 --> 01:15:48,041
Yu, itu Guru Asri yang nentuin.

1161
01:15:48,125 --> 01:15:49,833
Di sini nggak nentuin apa-apa, Yu!

1162
01:15:49,916 --> 01:15:53,125
Yu, kalau ini nggak dibantuin,
kita kagak ada yang bisa jadi perasuk

1163
01:16:14,958 --> 01:16:17,750
Sini gua obatin dulu badan lu.

1164
01:16:17,833 --> 01:16:20,208
Terus latihan dah, gua temenin.

1165
01:16:32,333 --> 01:16:35,000
Buset dah, Yu.

1166
01:16:36,875 --> 01:16:39,333
Harus sampai begini amat apa?

1167
01:16:41,333 --> 01:16:43,083
Iya, gua tau.

1168
01:16:43,166 --> 01:16:48,041
Lu marah, 'kan, gara-gara gua
suka sama roh kerbaunya Pawit?

1169
01:16:50,125 --> 01:16:52,708
Bukan berarti roh kutu lu jelek.

1170
01:16:52,791 --> 01:16:55,791
Lu bilang, mau jadi perasuk,

1171
01:16:55,875 --> 01:16:57,916
karena seneng lihat orang lain seneng.

1172
01:16:58,000 --> 01:17:00,375
{\an8}Mana ada orang lain seneng
lihat lu kayak gini?

1173
01:17:02,208 --> 01:17:05,250
Pesta sambetan tuh
intinya seneng-seneng, Yu.

1174
01:17:05,333 --> 01:17:06,875
Malah nyiksa diri gini.

1175
01:18:13,500 --> 01:18:14,375
Yu?

1176
01:18:19,333 --> 01:18:20,500
Bayu?

1177
01:18:20,583 --> 01:18:23,750
Bayu kagak bakal balik Jakarta lagi.

1178
01:18:23,833 --> 01:18:25,416
Dengerin Bapak ngomong dulu, Yu.

1179
01:18:25,500 --> 01:18:27,000
Bayu kagak mau

1180
01:18:27,083 --> 01:18:28,583
makan dua hari sekali lagi.

1181
01:18:29,583 --> 01:18:32,083
Pakde Rahmat, Tante Wati,
itu udah sepakat.

1182
01:18:33,458 --> 01:18:34,583
Bayu capek

1183
01:18:35,333 --> 01:18:38,125
sama semua usaha Bapak
yang kagak pernah jelas.

1184
01:18:39,000 --> 01:18:41,750
Ini Bapak mau jelasin
tapi 'kan lu kagak ada seminggu.

1185
01:18:44,250 --> 01:18:46,000
- Yu?
- Ibu pergi,

1186
01:18:46,083 --> 01:18:47,458
itu gegara Bapak!

1187
01:18:48,750 --> 01:18:50,083
Bayu bakal balikin

1188
01:18:50,583 --> 01:18:52,041
semua kesialan itu.

1189
01:19:08,041 --> 01:19:12,666
Maaf ya, Yu, kalau Bapak kagak bisa
kayak bapak-bapak yang lain.

1190
01:19:12,750 --> 01:19:14,875
Bapak udah jadi orang gagal.

1191
01:19:14,958 --> 01:19:18,916
Makanya Bapak kagak kepingin
ngalangin kerjaan lu di sini.

1192
01:19:19,000 --> 01:19:21,125
Ini 'kan rumah udah dijual, Yu,

1193
01:19:21,208 --> 01:19:23,333
tapi Bapak ngotot sama Pakde Rahmat…

1194
01:19:25,958 --> 01:19:27,666
supaya kandang kagak dijual.

1195
01:19:28,541 --> 01:19:30,541
Supaya lu nanti bisa tinggal di sini, Yu.

1196
01:19:31,958 --> 01:19:33,958
Lu itu udah dapet apa yang lu mau, Yu.

1197
01:19:37,708 --> 01:19:38,708
Tapi Bapak belum.

1198
01:19:41,083 --> 01:19:43,041
Biarin Bapak coba sekali lagi, ya?

1199
01:20:10,041 --> 01:20:11,166
Jangan ngilang ngapa.

1200
01:20:11,833 --> 01:20:13,458
Jangan ngilang ngapa.

1201
01:20:13,541 --> 01:20:16,083
{\an8}Saya lintah, saya lintah.

1202
01:20:16,833 --> 01:20:18,541
{\an8}Jangan ngilang.

1203
01:21:14,958 --> 01:21:17,500
Macan bulan depan hutan!

1204
01:21:17,583 --> 01:21:20,416
Paman tampan bukan umpan!

1205
01:21:38,333 --> 01:21:39,666
Roh jago.

1206
01:21:39,750 --> 01:21:41,166
Ayam jago kebal maut!

1207
01:21:41,250 --> 01:21:44,291
Dalam kargo kapal laut!

1208
01:22:04,291 --> 01:22:05,791
Roh lintah.

1209
01:22:05,875 --> 01:22:07,750
Kota hutan lintah!

1210
01:22:07,833 --> 01:22:10,708
Kita makan mentah-mentah!

1211
01:22:24,000 --> 01:22:28,291
<i>Roh lintah bakal ngisep</i>
<i>semua orang yang pernah nyakitin diri lu.</i>

1212
01:22:28,375 --> 01:22:31,500
<i>Bapak, sahabat, kekasih, sepupu,</i>

1213
01:22:31,583 --> 01:22:34,083
<i>kering semua kesedot roh lintah!</i>

1214
01:22:36,416 --> 01:22:38,958
<i>Buat yang pernah ribut masalah warisan,</i>

1215
01:22:39,083 --> 01:22:41,250
<i>lintah sedot sampai mampus.</i>

1216
01:22:42,333 --> 01:22:44,708
<i>Temen masa kecil yang bikin sakit hati,</i>

1217
01:22:44,791 --> 01:22:46,833
<i>lintah pecahin kagak ada sisa.</i>

1218
01:22:55,333 --> 01:23:00,541
<i>Tetangga, pasangan yang selingkuh,</i>
<i>tukang tipu, tukang nyolong,</i>

1219
01:23:00,625 --> 01:23:02,833
<i>lintah cairin semua jadi air.</i>

1220
01:23:07,541 --> 01:23:10,708
<i>Dunia bakal lebih enak,</i>
<i>kalau kagak ada orang jahat.</i>

1221
01:23:10,791 --> 01:23:14,375
<i>Dunia bakal lebih enak,</i>
<i>kalau semua orang baik!</i>

1222
01:23:14,458 --> 01:23:19,333
<i>Dunia bakal lebih enak,</i>
<i>kalau orang kagak pada nyakitin</i>

1223
01:23:22,958 --> 01:23:27,083
<i>Lintah sedot semua!</i>

1224
01:23:36,333 --> 01:23:39,333
Sekarang kita dengerin hasil pemilihan.

1225
01:23:43,375 --> 01:23:44,625
Bayu.

1226
01:23:48,666 --> 01:23:49,791
Ananto.

1227
01:23:53,500 --> 01:23:54,541
Bayu.

1228
01:23:58,583 --> 01:23:59,625
Ananto.

1229
01:24:03,708 --> 01:24:05,791
Dan suara terakhir…

1230
01:24:14,083 --> 01:24:15,458
Ananto.

1231
01:24:16,458 --> 01:24:17,458
Hasilnya?

1232
01:24:17,541 --> 01:24:21,916
Bayu dua suara, Pawit nol suara,
Ananto tiga suara.

1233
01:24:22,000 --> 01:24:23,750
Kita punya perasuk baru,

1234
01:24:23,833 --> 01:24:25,333
Ananto Prasetya!

1235
01:24:25,416 --> 01:24:32,416
<i>Biar kata, panas kayak lagi ngelas</i>

1236
01:24:33,375 --> 01:24:40,375
<i>Latas sentosa kagak putus asa</i>

1237
01:24:40,916 --> 01:24:47,916
<i>Sawah kuning banyak cacing</i>

1238
01:24:48,708 --> 01:24:52,333
- <i>Kambingnya subur…</i>
- Roh lintah yang barusan,

1239
01:24:53,541 --> 01:24:55,625
udah 20 tahun kagak nongol.

1240
01:24:56,958 --> 01:24:59,791
Kita kagum Bayu bisa salurin.

1241
01:25:01,000 --> 01:25:04,833
Tapi rasanya,
tadi bukan bikin kita makin seneng.

1242
01:25:05,833 --> 01:25:07,333
Tapi bikin kita

1243
01:25:08,250 --> 01:25:10,458
pengin ngebunuh orang
yang kagak kita suka.

1244
01:25:12,083 --> 01:25:14,291
Jadi kurang tepat kalau buat ini kampung.

1245
01:26:10,833 --> 01:26:12,458
Ini roh apa lagi, Mas?

1246
01:26:16,000 --> 01:26:17,375
Boleh saya ikut?

1247
01:26:22,208 --> 01:26:23,708
Saya juga capek, Mas.

1248
01:26:28,000 --> 01:26:31,000
Saya ngerti banget
apa yang dirasain sama Mas Bayu.

1249
01:26:40,208 --> 01:26:41,583
{\an8}Ditinggal orang tua.

1250
01:26:44,833 --> 01:26:46,375
{\an8}Nggak dihargain.

1251
01:27:10,375 --> 01:27:11,791
Pak Banar,

1252
01:27:12,583 --> 01:27:14,583
Bayu gagal jadi perasuk.

1253
01:27:14,666 --> 01:27:17,250
Ini gegara Bapak Bayu nyakitin hati Bayu.

1254
01:27:17,333 --> 01:27:19,333
Sabar, Yu, sabar.

1255
01:27:19,416 --> 01:27:22,125
Jadi perasuk itu banyak makan hati.

1256
01:27:22,833 --> 01:27:27,791
Karena jatah seneng-seneng kita
diberikan kepada orang lain.

1257
01:27:27,875 --> 01:27:29,291
Bayu udah puasa, Pak,

1258
01:27:29,375 --> 01:27:31,000
udah bukan bau orang ini, Pak.

1259
01:27:31,083 --> 01:27:33,125
Biar bisa kayak Pak Banar.

1260
01:27:33,208 --> 01:27:36,416
Kagak apa-apa kagak punya bini,
kagak punya keluarga.

1261
01:27:36,500 --> 01:27:38,125
Kagak punya keluarga?

1262
01:27:38,208 --> 01:27:39,958
Asal ngucap ini bocah.

1263
01:27:40,708 --> 01:27:43,333
Emang selama ini lu nggak pernah kepikiran

1264
01:27:43,958 --> 01:27:46,750
kenapa saya pakai jaket terus?

1265
01:27:46,833 --> 01:27:48,250
Badan ini kurus,

1266
01:27:48,333 --> 01:27:49,750
perut segede paus.

1267
01:27:49,833 --> 01:27:51,750
Ngerti kuda laut gak lu, Yu?

1268
01:27:54,083 --> 01:27:56,000
Kuda laut betina

1269
01:27:57,000 --> 01:27:59,875
menitipkan bayi-bayi
kepada kuda laut jantan.

1270
01:28:06,625 --> 01:28:07,541
Pak.

1271
01:28:12,333 --> 01:28:14,083
Jangan, Pak!

1272
01:28:17,708 --> 01:28:19,375
Kalau kemarin kamu gagal,

1273
01:28:19,458 --> 01:28:21,833
kamu kurang hidup kayak roh itu.

1274
01:28:22,708 --> 01:28:27,041
Kuda laut jantanlah yang mengandung
bayi-bayi kuda laut itu, Yu.

1275
01:28:27,958 --> 01:28:30,166
Saya harus jadi kuda laut itu, Yu.

1276
01:28:30,833 --> 01:28:33,875
Emang selama ini,
kamu pikir saya tidak punya anak?

1277
01:28:35,958 --> 01:28:37,666
Ini anak saya, Yu.

1278
01:28:37,750 --> 01:28:39,958
Selama ini anteng di perut ini, Yu.

1279
01:28:40,583 --> 01:28:42,583
Semua ada harganya, Yu.

1280
01:28:42,666 --> 01:28:45,125
Bahkan keluarga kita sendiri.

1281
01:28:51,208 --> 01:28:52,083
Yu.

1282
01:28:53,375 --> 01:28:55,541
Gua tau, lu lagi kagak konsen,

1283
01:28:55,625 --> 01:28:57,208
tapi gua minta tolong.

1284
01:28:58,083 --> 01:29:00,541
Lu bisa nggak surupin gua sekarang?

1285
01:29:02,208 --> 01:29:03,625
Hari ini hujan.

1286
01:29:04,333 --> 01:29:06,458
Lu tau gua gimana kalau hujan.

1287
01:29:07,333 --> 01:29:10,458
'Kan bisa sekalian jadi tempat lu latihan.

1288
01:29:10,541 --> 01:29:12,666
Lu inget 'kan lu kasih ke gue

1289
01:29:12,750 --> 01:29:14,625
gratis kapan aja mau sambetan.

1290
01:29:17,416 --> 01:29:19,416
{\an8}Gua butuh sekarang, Yu.

1291
01:29:19,500 --> 01:29:21,208
Oh, gua tau.

1292
01:29:21,291 --> 01:29:22,875
Syarat lu baru 'kan sekarang?

1293
01:29:22,958 --> 01:29:25,291
Lu harus nyedot darah gua kayak lintah.

1294
01:29:31,250 --> 01:29:32,333
Minum darah gua.

1295
01:29:42,125 --> 01:29:44,458
Ya udah kalo lu nggak mau sambetin gua,

1296
01:29:44,541 --> 01:29:46,000
biar gua sendirian aja.

1297
01:29:46,833 --> 01:29:48,625
<i>Kota hutan lintah!</i>

1298
01:29:48,708 --> 01:29:51,333
<i>Kita makan mentah-mentah!</i>

1299
01:30:56,833 --> 01:30:57,958
Laksmi?

1300
01:31:03,458 --> 01:31:04,583
Laksmi!

1301
01:31:05,708 --> 01:31:06,833
Laksmi!

1302
01:31:09,958 --> 01:31:11,083
Laksmi!

1303
01:31:14,083 --> 01:31:15,375
- Tolong!
- Laksmi!

1304
01:31:15,458 --> 01:31:17,250
Kandang ayam diserang!

1305
01:31:17,333 --> 01:31:19,583
- Kandang ayam diserang!
- Laksmi!

1306
01:31:19,666 --> 01:31:20,583
Laksmi!

1307
01:31:36,958 --> 01:31:37,916
Laksmi!

1308
01:31:39,500 --> 01:31:40,333
Laksmi!

1309
01:31:41,083 --> 01:31:42,083
Laksmi!

1310
01:31:50,458 --> 01:31:51,291
Laksmi!

1311
01:32:00,583 --> 01:32:01,416
Mi!

1312
01:32:02,500 --> 01:32:03,333
Laksmi!

1313
01:32:29,208 --> 01:32:30,041
Mi!

1314
01:32:49,833 --> 01:32:50,666
Mi.

1315
01:32:50,833 --> 01:32:51,666
Mi.

1316
01:32:56,333 --> 01:32:57,166
Mi.

1317
01:32:57,583 --> 01:32:58,833
Mi, Sadar, Mi!

1318
01:32:59,833 --> 01:33:02,333
Gua janji gua bakal nemenin lu
abis ini, Mi.

1319
01:33:03,708 --> 01:33:04,541
Mi.

1320
01:33:34,041 --> 01:33:35,083
Sekarang, Yu!

1321
01:34:00,333 --> 01:34:01,583
Masih mau batu?

1322
01:34:03,250 --> 01:34:04,583
Masih mau apa-apa sendiri?

1323
01:34:05,166 --> 01:34:07,208
Ini bisa bikin Laksmi mati, tau nggak?

1324
01:34:20,333 --> 01:34:24,250
Yang bunuhin ayam sudah ketemu,
semua unit cepat merapat.

1325
01:34:34,791 --> 01:34:36,625
Ini udah dua kali loh, Bu.

1326
01:34:38,250 --> 01:34:40,208
Kami yang nggak salah apa-apa,

1327
01:34:41,083 --> 01:34:44,250
diteror terus sama komunitas Ibu.

1328
01:34:44,333 --> 01:34:46,500
Iya, tenang aja dulu, biar saya aja yang…

1329
01:34:46,583 --> 01:34:48,875
Iya, jelasin apa?

1330
01:34:48,958 --> 01:34:49,875
Liat.

1331
01:34:50,583 --> 01:34:52,458
- Liat.
- Lah, lah, iya, iya.

1332
01:34:52,541 --> 01:34:54,625
Ngerti, ngerti. Keliatan kok, keliatan.

1333
01:34:54,708 --> 01:34:56,291
Keliatan, kagak usah deket-deket.

1334
01:34:59,458 --> 01:35:02,708
Ya, saya udah bicara sama pihak Wanaria.

1335
01:35:03,958 --> 01:35:07,000
Katanya mereka rugi sekitar 20 jutaan

1336
01:35:07,083 --> 01:35:08,708
gara-gara kejadian ini.

1337
01:35:09,833 --> 01:35:11,333
Situ bisa nanggung?

1338
01:35:12,083 --> 01:35:12,958
Bisa, Bu.

1339
01:35:13,708 --> 01:35:14,958
Maaf gara-gara saya.

1340
01:35:15,041 --> 01:35:16,541
Udah, udah, nggak apa-apa.

1341
01:35:16,625 --> 01:35:19,333
Mending kamu istirahat aja ya,
di rumah saya.

1342
01:35:22,208 --> 01:35:23,625
Buat Bayu…

1343
01:35:25,458 --> 01:35:27,583
Kupu mencok di atas tanduk.

1344
01:35:28,833 --> 01:35:30,625
Mau ditangkep,

1345
01:35:30,708 --> 01:35:32,333
dianya terbang.

1346
01:35:34,791 --> 01:35:37,041
Cari emas sampai remuk.

1347
01:35:38,541 --> 01:35:40,208
Pas udah dapet…

1348
01:35:41,916 --> 01:35:44,041
orang yang disayang hilang.

1349
01:36:00,666 --> 01:36:03,125
Mestinya gua nggak maksain
nebus voucer lu.

1350
01:36:07,708 --> 01:36:10,833
Kalau dipikir-pikir,
abang gua meninggal juga gara-gara voucer.

1351
01:36:17,041 --> 01:36:20,166
20 persen doang diskonnya
dari toko sepatu.

1352
01:36:24,416 --> 01:36:26,666
Sepatu gua juga udah banyak di rumah.

1353
01:36:35,916 --> 01:36:38,541
Coba gua udah ngerasa cukup, ya…

1354
01:36:42,291 --> 01:36:44,583
mungkin abang gua masih hidup sekarang.

1355
01:36:49,541 --> 01:36:53,166
Mestinya gua yang tanggung jawab
buat nyenengin lu.

1356
01:36:53,250 --> 01:36:54,666
Gua yang minta maaf.

1357
01:36:55,666 --> 01:37:00,083
Gua harusnya tau lu lagi sedih
gegara rumah lu dijual Bapak.

1358
01:37:00,166 --> 01:37:02,291
Dia kagak pernah belajar.

1359
01:37:02,375 --> 01:37:04,125
Kagak pernah kapok.

1360
01:37:04,208 --> 01:37:06,375
Kagak pernah ngerasa cukup.

1361
01:37:08,666 --> 01:37:10,583
Ya, mungkin…

1362
01:37:13,041 --> 01:37:16,041
dia udah ngerasa cukup
buat dirinya sendiri,

1363
01:37:16,125 --> 01:37:20,375
cuman belum ngerasa
cukup jadi Bapak buat lu.

1364
01:38:57,291 --> 01:38:58,958
Lu itu mesti tau,

1365
01:38:59,041 --> 01:39:01,166
kalau selama lu surupin gua,

1366
01:39:01,250 --> 01:39:02,750
gua rasanya seneng.

1367
01:39:03,958 --> 01:39:06,875
Jadi lu harus percaya
sama diri lu sendiri,

1368
01:39:06,958 --> 01:39:08,750
kalau lu itu perasuk yang hebat.

1369
01:39:11,041 --> 01:39:12,041
Lancar-lancar, ya.

1370
01:39:16,166 --> 01:39:19,416
Cie, selompret baru.

1371
01:39:20,041 --> 01:39:21,375
Selompret baru.

1372
01:39:24,666 --> 01:39:26,916
Dari Bapak ini.

1373
01:39:27,916 --> 01:39:29,333
Dari paralon.

1374
01:39:29,416 --> 01:39:31,333
Akhirnya yang kita tunggu-tunggu,

1375
01:39:31,416 --> 01:39:35,416
selamat datang di Pesta Sambetan Akbar
Mata Air Roh Desa Latas!

1376
01:39:37,208 --> 01:39:40,208
Keuntungan yang kita dapat ini hari,

1377
01:39:40,291 --> 01:39:43,416
bakal digunain buat ngebeli
itu mata air dari Pak Dawuri.

1378
01:39:44,291 --> 01:39:47,083
Abis kelar seleksi panjang
dari delapan sanggar di Latas,

1379
01:39:47,208 --> 01:39:50,333
saya mau ngenalin
perasuk baru yang kepilih

1380
01:39:50,416 --> 01:39:54,166
buat mimpin kampung kita, Ananto Prasetya!

1381
01:39:56,875 --> 01:39:59,125
Asisten perasuk yang kepilih,

1382
01:39:59,208 --> 01:40:02,041
Pawit Arifin ama Bayu Laksana!

1383
01:40:05,291 --> 01:40:07,625
Macan makan bulan depan!

1384
01:40:07,708 --> 01:40:11,041
Jangan tahan tangan kanan!

1385
01:40:51,625 --> 01:40:53,916
Itu sekuriti kenapa pada ke mari?

1386
01:41:10,541 --> 01:41:11,625
Siapa, tuh?

1387
01:41:11,708 --> 01:41:13,625
Yu, lu kenal nggak?

1388
01:41:34,541 --> 01:41:35,625
Tolong!

1389
01:41:35,708 --> 01:41:36,708
Ada pelamun nyerang!

1390
01:41:36,791 --> 01:41:39,250
- Bohong!
- Ini ada bukti videonya!

1391
01:41:39,333 --> 01:41:40,291
Bukan kerasukan itu!

1392
01:41:40,375 --> 01:41:41,875
<i>Pelamun menyerang warga…</i>

1393
01:41:41,958 --> 01:41:44,833
Jangan sentuh pelamun!
Jangan sentuh pelamun!

1394
01:41:44,916 --> 01:41:46,625
Pelamun, jangan ada yang menyerang!

1395
01:41:46,708 --> 01:41:49,500
<i>Pelamun menyerang warga,</i>
<i>kami ada bukti videonya.</i>

1396
01:41:49,583 --> 01:41:52,958
<i>Pelamun membuat kerusuhan!</i>

1397
01:41:54,666 --> 01:41:59,791
<i>Mohon perhatian, seluruh warga</i>
<i>diharap bubar dengan tertib!</i>

1398
01:41:59,875 --> 01:42:02,083
<i>Telah dilaporkan seorang pelamun…</i>

1399
01:42:02,166 --> 01:42:03,208
Bubar, bubar!

1400
01:42:04,791 --> 01:42:09,125
<i>Mohon perhatian, seluruh warga</i>
<i>diharap bubar dengan tertib!</i>

1401
01:42:10,125 --> 01:42:13,791
<i>Telah dilaporkan seorang pelamun</i>
<i>menyerang warga.</i>

1402
01:42:13,875 --> 01:42:19,041
<i>Pesta sambetan telah berkali-kali</i>
<i>membuat resah dan mengganggu warga!</i>

1403
01:42:19,583 --> 01:42:20,958
<i>Evakuasi pesta sambetan…</i>

1404
01:42:21,041 --> 01:42:22,875
Kurang ajar kalian semua!

1405
01:42:22,958 --> 01:42:24,416
Ini kebohongan!

1406
01:42:24,500 --> 01:42:29,541
<i>Mohon perhatian, seluruh warga</i>
<i>diharap bubar dengan tertib!</i>

1407
01:42:30,000 --> 01:42:33,916
<i>Telah dilaporkan seorang pelamun</i>
<i>menyerang warga!</i>

1408
01:42:34,500 --> 01:42:39,416
<i>Pesta sambetan telah berkali-kali</i>
<i>membuat resah dan mengganggu warga!</i>

1409
01:42:39,916 --> 01:42:43,416
<i>Evakuasi pesta sambetan</i>
<i>akan segera dimulai!</i>

1410
01:42:44,166 --> 01:42:48,916
<i>Demi ketertiban, mohon meninggalkan area</i>
<i>dengan tertib dan teratur!</i>

1411
01:42:52,041 --> 01:42:55,666
Guru Asri, Mantra Bulus!
Pawit, Ananto, iringin!

1412
01:42:55,750 --> 01:42:57,416
Panggil semua bocah pelamun!

1413
01:42:58,916 --> 01:43:01,291
<i>Bulus melindungi diri!</i>

1414
01:43:01,375 --> 01:43:04,541
<i>Terbungkus inti sari!</i>

1415
01:43:29,000 --> 01:43:30,875
Bu Asri, Alam Pijat!

1416
01:43:38,625 --> 01:43:41,416
Bayu, masukin itu warga!

1417
01:43:52,541 --> 01:43:54,625
Rotan Bulus, Yu!

1418
01:43:54,708 --> 01:43:56,458
Lindungin kulitnya!

1419
01:44:09,291 --> 01:44:12,791
<i>Mi, maafin ya udah ninggalin Laksmi.</i>

1420
01:44:12,875 --> 01:44:16,083
<i>To, maafin ya udah nganggap situ saingan.</i>

1421
01:44:16,166 --> 01:44:18,458
<i>Wit, makasih ya udah nolongin mulu.</i>

1422
01:44:19,583 --> 01:44:22,083
<i>Bu, makasih udah ngajarin saya.</i>

1423
01:44:23,166 --> 01:44:24,583
<i>Warga Latas,</i>

1424
01:44:24,666 --> 01:44:26,458
<i>maafin saya udah egois.</i>

1425
01:44:32,916 --> 01:44:36,166
<i>Masa lalu saya, Manusia Silver,</i>

1426
01:44:37,000 --> 01:44:40,083
<i>makasih udah bisa ngelewatin ini semua.</i>

1427
01:44:41,541 --> 01:44:43,666
<i>Makasih udah hidup.</i>

1428
01:44:44,541 --> 01:44:47,000
Rotan Bulus!

1429
01:45:52,291 --> 01:45:55,041
Ananto, roh semut! Pawit, Lingkar Candu!

1430
01:45:55,125 --> 01:45:56,666
Yu, yakin lu?

1431
01:45:56,750 --> 01:45:58,583
Semut rambut kusut!

1432
01:45:58,666 --> 01:46:01,375
Perut turut carut marut!

1433
01:46:33,041 --> 01:46:33,875
Yu!

1434
01:46:34,333 --> 01:46:37,208
Ini roh semut rangrang
bakal liat itu sekuriti jadi umpan!

1435
01:46:38,916 --> 01:46:40,750
Ini mereka semua beneran mau dimakan?

1436
01:46:42,416 --> 01:46:44,625
Jangan, jangan ada yang ngelukain!

1437
01:46:47,041 --> 01:46:49,541
<i>Yu, ini bisa pakai roh lintah,</i>

1438
01:46:49,625 --> 01:46:53,583
<i>Hancurin itu semua sekuriti,</i>
<i>sedot sampai mati,</i>

1439
01:46:53,666 --> 01:46:56,041
<i>Mereka pantes dapetin itu.</i>

1440
01:46:56,166 --> 01:46:58,166
<i>Kagak, kagak, kagak.</i>

1441
01:46:58,291 --> 01:46:59,916
<i>Bukan.</i>

1442
01:47:00,000 --> 01:47:01,041
<i>Bukan kayak begitu.</i>

1443
01:47:01,833 --> 01:47:04,208
<i>Yu, dia belum tentu orang jahat kali.</i>

1444
01:47:04,291 --> 01:47:07,166
<i>Barangkali aja dia cuman</i>
<i>nurutin perintah atasannya.</i>

1445
01:47:08,666 --> 01:47:11,083
<i>Yu, belum tentu dia itu penuh dendam.</i>

1446
01:47:11,166 --> 01:47:14,625
<i>Kali aja di rumah dia punya</i>
<i>anak bini yang butuh makan juga.</i>

1447
01:47:15,375 --> 01:47:17,541
<i>Dia, dia juga belum tentu tukang bunuh.</i>

1448
01:47:17,916 --> 01:47:20,208
<i>Barangkali dia punya Bapak</i>
<i>yang sakit di rumah.</i>

1449
01:47:21,291 --> 01:47:22,791
<i>Mereka cuma butuh didekap.</i>

1450
01:47:32,916 --> 01:47:36,333
<i>Nah ini orang, mungkin dia kagak jahat.</i>

1451
01:47:36,416 --> 01:47:38,291
<i>Mungkin dia cuma butuh buktiin sesuatu.</i>

1452
01:47:38,916 --> 01:47:41,583
<i>Mungkin dia pernah disakiti</i>
<i>kagak dianggap kayak Bayu.</i>

1453
01:47:41,666 --> 01:47:43,833
<i>Dia cuma belum ngerasa cukup aja, sih.</i>

1454
01:47:47,666 --> 01:47:50,416
<i>Bapak, Bapak sendirian mulu dari dulu.</i>

1455
01:47:51,166 --> 01:47:53,458
<i>Dia dipenjara, dipukulin,</i>

1456
01:47:53,541 --> 01:47:55,333
<i>gegara dia nyolong </i>handphone.

1457
01:47:56,041 --> 01:47:57,833
<i>Abis kita berdua kelaperan,</i>

1458
01:47:57,916 --> 01:47:59,458
<i>dia diceraiin istrinya</i>

1459
01:47:59,541 --> 01:48:01,291
<i>sebab usahanya ditipu orang mulu.</i>

1460
01:48:01,916 --> 01:48:03,583
<i>Usaha tanaman gagal,</i>

1461
01:48:03,666 --> 01:48:05,125
<i>batu akik gagal,</i>

1462
01:48:05,208 --> 01:48:07,291
<i>ikan cupang gagal,</i>

1463
01:48:07,416 --> 01:48:09,541
<i>Bapak lakuin itu semua buat Bayu.</i>

1464
01:48:09,625 --> 01:48:11,583
<i>Dia udah ngerasa cukup buat dirinya,</i>

1465
01:48:11,666 --> 01:48:14,208
<i>Tapi dia belum ngerasa cukup buat Bayu.</i>

1466
01:48:14,291 --> 01:48:15,333
<i>Maafin Bayu ya, Pak.</i>

1467
01:48:15,916 --> 01:48:18,791
<i>Makasih ya, Pak, Bapak kagak sendirian.</i>

1468
01:48:35,333 --> 01:48:37,125
Kagak kuat lagi nih nahannya!

1469
01:48:38,666 --> 01:48:41,916
Roh monyet!
Mantra latihan dasar pelukan monyet!

1470
01:48:48,416 --> 01:48:49,750
Monyet makan pisang tanduk!

1471
01:48:49,833 --> 01:48:53,291
Jangan sungkan, kasih peluk!

1472
01:49:30,791 --> 01:49:34,333
<i>Melalui kesempatan kali ini,</i>
<i>saya ingin meluruskan satu hal</i>

1473
01:49:34,416 --> 01:49:37,791
<i>terkait insiden pemukulan</i>
<i>yang terjadi di pesta sambetan kemarin.</i>

1474
01:49:37,875 --> 01:49:41,791
Hal itu tidak ada sangkut pautnya
dengan PT Wanaria.

1475
01:49:41,875 --> 01:49:45,041
Kami tidak pernah menginstruksikan
hal-hal seperti itu terjadi,

1476
01:49:45,125 --> 01:49:47,291
dan kami juga mengutuk keras
para pelakunya.

1477
01:49:47,375 --> 01:49:49,500
<i>Kami juga meyakini memang bahwa ada</i>

1478
01:49:49,583 --> 01:49:51,500
<i>oknum perusahaan sekuriti yang terlibat</i>

1479
01:49:51,583 --> 01:49:54,666
<i>dengan warga setempat</i>
<i>yang memiliki perselisihan pribadi.</i>

1480
01:49:54,750 --> 01:49:57,958
Kami, PT Wanaria,
sudah memutuskan hubungan kerja sama

1481
01:49:58,041 --> 01:50:00,541
dengan perusahaan sekuriti tersebut.

1482
01:50:00,625 --> 01:50:04,041
Kami juga sudah merekrut
perusahaan sekuriti yang baru.

1483
01:50:04,125 --> 01:50:09,416
<i>Kami ingin melestarikan</i>
<i>budaya pesta sambetan di Desa Latas ini.</i>

1484
01:50:09,500 --> 01:50:10,958
Harapannya apa?

1485
01:50:11,041 --> 01:50:15,375
Agar wisatawan lokal,
wisatawan mancanegara, bisa hadir di sini.

1486
01:50:16,166 --> 01:50:18,666
Dan kami juga sudah memikirkan
jauh ke depan sana

1487
01:50:18,750 --> 01:50:21,625
untuk mengemasnya
menjadi sesuatu yang global.

1488
01:50:21,708 --> 01:50:23,458
Pembohong! Pembohong!

1489
01:50:23,583 --> 01:50:25,083
Wanaria dalang pemukulan!

1490
01:50:25,166 --> 01:50:27,000
- Pembohong!
- Ungkap kebenarannya!

1491
01:50:51,875 --> 01:50:53,458
Kita kudu bersyukur,

1492
01:50:54,458 --> 01:50:57,791
mata air kagak jadi jatuh ke PT Wanaria.

1493
01:50:57,875 --> 01:51:00,000
Tapi kita-kita juga kudu tau,

1494
01:51:00,875 --> 01:51:04,333
kalau perjuangan kita ini belum beres.

1495
01:51:04,416 --> 01:51:05,916
Wanaria masih di sini!

1496
01:51:06,000 --> 01:51:08,458
Dan yang kita lakuin ini,

1497
01:51:08,541 --> 01:51:11,958
satu bentuk perlawanan ke tuh PT!

1498
01:52:26,791 --> 01:52:29,583
Mas Bayu, mau teh, kopi, jeruk?

1499
01:52:29,666 --> 01:52:31,416
Air putih aja, Bu.

1500
01:52:36,041 --> 01:52:38,625
Jadi, Ananto yang kepilih?

1501
01:52:38,708 --> 01:52:39,666
Iya.

1502
01:52:40,333 --> 01:52:43,583
Tapi kagak ngapa-ngapa,
sawah doi jadi aman itu.

1503
01:52:43,666 --> 01:52:44,916
Nggak apa-apa dah.

1504
01:52:45,416 --> 01:52:47,125
Entar juga ada kesempatan lagi, ya.

1505
01:52:47,958 --> 01:52:48,916
Iya.

1506
01:52:49,666 --> 01:52:52,166
- Rumah gimana rumah, aman?
- Aman.

1507
01:52:52,666 --> 01:52:54,958
Samping pekarangan kagak jadi dibangun.

1508
01:52:55,041 --> 01:52:57,333
Gara-gara kejadian kemarin,

1509
01:52:57,416 --> 01:52:59,916
denger-denger pemodal resto pada cabut.

1510
01:53:00,000 --> 01:53:02,083
Ya udah dibiarin pada mangkrak aja gitu.

1511
01:53:02,166 --> 01:53:03,541
Iya, iya.

1512
01:53:03,625 --> 01:53:06,166
Wah, ini anak-anaknya Bu Nana.

1513
01:53:06,250 --> 01:53:07,458
Halo.

1514
01:53:07,541 --> 01:53:09,208
- Halo, Kak.
- Hai.

1515
01:53:09,291 --> 01:53:11,250
Om, pamit main bola dulu, ya.

1516
01:53:11,333 --> 01:53:12,458
- Hati-hati, ya.
- Iya.

1517
01:53:13,083 --> 01:53:16,291
Buset, jadi om-om, nih?

1518
01:53:17,041 --> 01:53:19,333
Tau tuh, belum biasa
manggil Bapak kayaknya.

1519
01:53:22,041 --> 01:53:25,166
Terus, punya roh baru apaan, Yu?

1520
01:53:25,791 --> 01:53:27,000
Roh kadal.

1521
01:53:27,791 --> 01:53:29,333
Kemarin Bayu baru dapetin.

1522
01:53:29,416 --> 01:53:30,875
Kadal mantep, tuh.

1523
01:53:31,791 --> 01:53:33,416
Tingkat tinggi tuh, Yu.

1524
01:53:33,500 --> 01:53:34,833
Mau cobain kagak?

1525
01:53:37,791 --> 01:53:39,000
Maksudnya?

1526
01:53:39,083 --> 01:53:40,791
Ya, roh kadal.

1527
01:53:41,708 --> 01:53:46,833
Bapak terakhir jadi pelamun
udah 20, 30 tahun lalu kali, ya?

1528
01:53:46,916 --> 01:53:48,416
35 tahun, lah.

1529
01:53:48,500 --> 01:53:50,666
Buset, lama bener.

1530
01:53:51,916 --> 01:53:55,583
Cobain kagak?
Mumpung Bayu bawa selompret, nih.

1531
01:53:59,041 --> 01:54:01,708
Mumpung Sabtu Minggu Bayu di Jakarta.

1532
01:54:01,791 --> 01:54:03,916
Senin sudah balik ke Latas.

1533
01:54:31,166 --> 01:54:33,083
Makan sotonya nggak usah, deh.

1534
01:54:33,666 --> 01:54:35,500
Mumpung belum sarapan juga.

1535
01:54:37,791 --> 01:54:38,833
Yuk.